sequenceDiagram
    participant Kubelet as Kubelet
    participant Controller as Controller Manager<br/>:8081/TCP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant APIServer as OpenShift APIServer<br/>config.openshift.io
    participant Kustomize as KustomizeProvider<br/>(embedded)
    participant Deployer as SSA Deployer<br/>(odh-platform-utils)
    participant GC as Garbage Collector<br/>(odh-platform-utils)

    Note over Controller: Startup & Leader Election
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Acquire Lease<br/>coordination.k8s.io/leases<br/>SA Token Auth
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Lease Acquired

    Note over Kubelet,Controller: Health Probes
    Kubelet->>Controller: GET /healthz :8081<br/>HTTP, No Auth
    Controller-->>Kubelet: 200 OK
    Kubelet->>Controller: GET /readyz :8081<br/>HTTP, No Auth
    Controller-->>Kubelet: 200 OK

    Note over Controller,GC: Reconciliation Loop (managementState=Managed)
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch Event: MCPLifecycleOperator CR<br/>Singleton "default"

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Get MCPLifecycleOperator CR<br/>SA Token Auth
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: CR spec (managementState, etc.)

    Controller->>APIServer: fetchTLSConfig<br/>Get APIServer resource<br/>TLS 1.2+
    APIServer-->>Controller: TLS min version, cipher suites

    Controller->>Kustomize: Render operand manifests<br/>(namespace, image, TLS params)
    Kustomize-->>Controller: Rendered resource list

    Controller->>Deployer: Apply resources via SSA<br/>Field ownership
    Deployer->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply<br/>MCPServer, Deployments, RBAC, etc.
    K8sAPI-->>Deployer: Applied
    Deployer-->>Controller: Success

    Controller->>GC: Garbage collect stale resources<br/>Label: PlatformPartOf
    GC->>K8sAPI: List resources by label<br/>Delete stale (not in desired set)
    K8sAPI-->>GC: Deleted
    GC-->>Controller: Cleanup complete

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Get operand Deployment<br/>Check readiness
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Deployment status

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Patch MCPLifecycleOperator/status<br/>Conditions: Available, Ready,<br/>ProvisioningSucceeded
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Status updated

    Note over Controller,GC: Removal Flow (managementState=Removed)
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch Event: MCPLifecycleOperator CR<br/>managementState=Removed

    Controller->>GC: Delete ALL owned resources<br/>Unconditional predicate
    GC->>K8sAPI: Delete all labeled resources
    K8sAPI-->>GC: Deleted
    GC-->>Controller: All resources removed

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Patch MCPLifecycleOperator/status<br/>All conditions=False
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Status updated
